  "history": [],
  "facts": [
    "Super Wizard Towers are a defensive building unlocked at Capital Hall level 3.",
    "The Super Wizard Tower is a Wizard Tower manned by a Super Wizard, who utilizes chain lightning to damage multiple targets too close to the initial target. Just like the Super Wizard troop, this chain lightning hits up to nine other targets for 40% of the damage dealt to the initial target."
  ],
